.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
.Dd July 31, 2026
.Dt NETWORKCMPCTL 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm networkcmpctl
.Nd inspect an injected NetworkCmp component
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm config
.Nm
.Cm info
.Nm
.Cm resolve
.Ar host
.Op Ar service
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a bounded diagnostic client for a NetworkCmp session injected by
.Xr serviced 8 .
All live operations use
.Xr libnetworkcmp 3 ;
the utility never opens kernel sockets and receives no additional network
authority.
.Pp
The commands are:
.Bl -tag -width resolve
.It Cm config
Print the canonical service-manifest declaration for this local component.
.It Cm info
Print the negotiated protocol version, feature mask, socket ceiling, and I/O
limits.
.It Cm resolve Ar host Op Ar service
Resolve a name through the component's bounded resolver and print each typed
endpoint.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr libnetworkcmp 3 ,
.Xr serviced 5 ,
.Xr localnetwork 8 ,
.Xr serviced 8
